<view class="community"><view class="title">绑定银行卡（模拟）</view><view class="notice">仅保存银行名称和4位测试尾号，未向银行验证、未开通真实收款。请勿填写真实卡号、身份证、姓名或预留手机号。</view><view wx:if="{{card}}" class="finance-hero"><view>{{card.bankName}}</view><view class="finance-amount">•••• {{card.lastFour}}</view><text>模拟已绑定 · 非真实银行卡</text><button bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}">解除模拟绑定</button></view><view class="card"><view class="field-label">银行名称（测试）</view><input data-key="bankName" bindinput="field" value="{{bankName}}" maxlength="50" placeholder="例如：测试银行"/><view class="field-label">测试尾号</view><input data-key="lastFour" bindinput="field" value="{{lastFour}}" type="number" maxlength="4" placeholder="例如：0001"/><view class="caption">有处理中提现时不能换绑或解绑。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认模拟绑定</button></view>
